{"kada": [{"id": "kada", "headword": "कद", "headword_slp1": "kada", "fold": "kada", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "क—द m. ‘water-giver’, a cloud, L.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "क-द See 3. क.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कदः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadaH"]}, {"id": "kadA", "headword": "कदा", "headword_slp1": "kadA", "fold": "kada", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "कदा॑ ind. (fr. 2. क), when? at what time? (with following fut. or pres. tense, Pāṇ. iii, 3, 5), RV.; MBh.; Pañcat. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "at some time, one day, RV. viii, 5, 22", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "how? RV. vii, 29, 3", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "with a following नु खलु, when about ? MBh. iii", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "with a following च and preceding यदा, whenever, as often as possible (e.g. यदा॑ कदा॑ च सुन॑वाम सो॑मम्, let us press out the Soma as often as may be or at all times, RV. iii, 53, 4)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "with a following चन॑, never at any time, RV.; AV.; TUp.; Hit. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(irr. also) at some time, one day, once, MBh. xiii; Kathās. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "न कदा॑, never, RV. vi, 21, 3; Subh.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "न कदा चन, never at any time, RV.; AV. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कदा चित्, at some time or other, sometimes, once", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "न कदा चित्, never", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कदापि, sometimes, now and then", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "न कदापि, never;", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कदा [cf. Zd. kadha; Gk. κότε and πότε; Lat. quando; Lith. kadà; Slav. kǔda.]", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kad": [{"id": "kad", "headword": "कद्", "headword_slp1": "kad", "fold": "kad", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. कद् cl. 1. Ā. कदते, चकाद (R. ed. Gorresio vi, 65, 23; but, R. ed. Bomb. vi, 86, 24 reads चकार),\nto be confused, suffer mentally;\nto grieve;\nto confound;\nto kill or hurt;\nto call;\nto cry or shed tears, Dhātup. xix, 10.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "2. क॑द् ind. (originally the neuter form of the interrogative pronoun क), a particle of interrogation (= Lat. nonne, num), RV.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "anything wrong or bad, BhP. vii, 5, 28 (cf. below)", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "= सुख, Nigh.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कद् is used, like किम्, with the particles चन and चिद्, ‘sometimes, now and then’", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कच्-चन with the negation न, ‘in no way or manner’, RV.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कच्-चिद् is also used, like the simple कद्, as a particle of interrogation (e.g. कच्चिद् दृष्टा त्वया राजन् दमयन्ती, was Damayantī seen by thee, O king?), MBh., or कच्चिद् may be translated by ‘I hope that’", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "at the beginning of a compound it may mark the uselessness, badness or defectiveness of anything, as in the following examples.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kadana": [{"id": "kadana", "headword": "कदन", "headword_slp1": "kadana", "fold": "kadana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "कदन n. destruction, killing, slaughter, MBh.; R.; Pañcat. &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कदनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadanaM"]}, {"id": "kadanna", "headword": "कदन्न", "headword_slp1": "kadanna", "fold": "kadana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "कद्—अन्न n. bad food or little food, BhP.; Śārṅg.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कद्—अन्न mfn. eating bad food, VarBṛS.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कदन्नं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kadannaM"]}], "kadanapura": [{"id": "kadanapura", "headword": "कदनपुर", "headword_slp1": "kadanapura", "fold": "kadanapura", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "क